      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4757,
        "endIndex": 4990,
        "text": "#### Candidate [8]: Study: China struggles to recruit foreign AI researchers\n* **What is confirmed:** The New York Times (Zeyi Yang) reported on October 6, 2026, on a study measuring AI talent migration flows between the US and China"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4992,
        "endIndex": 5149,
        "text": "The study reveals that for every 30 Chinese AI researchers working in the United States in 2025, only one researcher in China moved in the opposite direction"
