    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5151,
        "endIndex": 5344,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** While local Chinese AI researchers are increasingly staying in China due to domestic sector growth, attracting non-native/foreign researchers remains a major bottleneck"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5417,
        "endIndex": 5636,
        "text": "#### Candidate [11]: Google enters 3.6 GW power deal with Constellation Energy\n* **What is confirmed:** Google contracted for 3,590 MW (3.6 GW) of electricity from Constellation Energy in the US PJM Interconnection grid"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
